    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1952-p6.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The roots are \\(\\dfrac{7+\\sqrt{49+36}}2\\) and \\(\\dfrac{7-\\sqrt{49+36}}2.\\) Their positive difference is therefore \\(\\sqrt{85}.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
